Neovim Tutor: 07 TEXT OBJECTS

Goal
  Operate on logical text blocks.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Inside/around
  ciw  change inner word
  diw  delete inner word
  ci"  change inside quotes
  ci(  change inside parens
  da"  delete around quotes

Practice:
  - Use ci" inside a quoted string in this file.
  - Try ci( on a (parenthesized) phrase.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: Targets with motions
  d2w   delete two words
  y3j   yank 3 lines down
  c$    change to end of line

Practice:
  - Combine operators with motions.

End of lesson 07.
